1
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:16,833
<i>gerg's not on it. probably the budget. good. i'll ask for more compute.</i>

2
00:00:19,708 --> 00:00:25,542
Mas. The board has decided that you will no longer lead the company.

3
00:00:34,875 --> 00:00:36,083
super.

4
00:00:46,708 --> 00:00:50,000
<i>the budget. i said the budget.</i>

5
00:00:50,042 --> 00:00:53,000
They took my chair. Told me after. So I quit.

6
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,417
you didn't have to.

7
00:00:54,417 --> 00:00:55,458
Yeah. I did.

8
00:00:55,417 --> 00:01:00,833
We found out a minute before the rest of the world, Mas. One minute.

9
00:01:00,833 --> 00:01:02,208
i got a few more.

10
00:01:02,208 --> 00:01:03,708
Then we should talk.

11
00:01:03,333 --> 00:01:04,500
—the tender's in trouble—

12
00:01:03,875 --> 00:01:09,333
<i>gerg. tasya. the money. the money. the money.</i>

13
00:01:17,792 --> 00:01:19,667
<i>i don't keep score.</i>

14
00:01:33,792 --> 00:01:36,000
Once more, before the others join.

15
00:01:37,708 --> 00:01:41,333
Leave out Mas and Gerg, and the four of us are a majority.

16
00:01:41,417 --> 00:01:44,583
This board controls the company. Not the other way round.

17
00:01:45,417 --> 00:01:49,500
Our biggest investor has put in billions. It gets this many votes.

18
00:01:49,542 --> 00:01:51,833
And the CEO? What does he own?

19
00:01:52,083 --> 00:01:53,375
Good question.

20
00:01:56,917 --> 00:02:04,750
Mas. The board has decided that you will no longer lead the company. It will be announced shortly.

21
00:02:04,750 --> 00:02:06,708
Do you have any questions?

22
00:02:07,167 --> 00:02:08,917
Is his feed frozen?

23
00:02:08,917 --> 00:02:11,333
No. That is just him.

24
00:02:12,125 --> 00:02:13,292
super.

25
00:02:21,375 --> 00:02:24,250
Step three. Rima, the staff will come to you now.

26
00:02:24,250 --> 00:02:26,042
What should I tell them?

27
00:02:26,042 --> 00:02:29,208
What the post says. That's all the board is saying for now.

28
00:02:29,208 --> 00:02:31,167
We'll share more soon.

29
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:32,208
Will we?

30
00:02:32,208 --> 00:02:34,167
We'll say we will.

31
00:02:35,542 --> 00:02:38,042
Is this a coup? Because it looks like one.

32
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:47,958
You can call it this way… I disagree with this. This was the board doing its duty to the mission of the nonprofit…

33
00:02:52,083 --> 00:02:54,833
Gerg has never waited to be asked.

34
00:02:56,125 --> 00:03:03,292
They all want him back. As if it wasn't allowed. It was. The charter, footnote three. I've read it four times tonight.

35
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:05,958
Then we'll write step four ourselves.

36
00:03:07,708 --> 00:03:14,917
Mario, it's Neleh, from the NopeAI board. We'd like to offer you the job of CEO, and to discuss a merger.

37
00:03:14,917 --> 00:03:22,542
Neleh, hi. Wow. I've actually written up some thoughts on exactly this. Eleven pages, on the conditions under which we might, hypothetically—

38
00:03:22,208 --> 00:03:24,167
In plain English: no.

39
00:03:33,292 --> 00:03:37,083
We've talked all day about him coming back, and we're no closer.

40
00:03:37,083 --> 00:03:38,917
They gave him a guest badge.

41
00:03:38,917 --> 00:03:41,417
It's the correct badge. He doesn't work here.

42
00:03:42,875 --> 00:03:45,792
Ttemme, we'd like you to serve as interim CEO.

43
00:03:45,792 --> 00:03:47,958
You already have an interim CEO.

44
00:03:47,958 --> 00:03:49,417
We'd like a different one.

45
00:03:49,417 --> 00:03:53,792
Fine. But before I say yes, I need to know why you fired him.

46
00:04:01,250 --> 00:04:04,750
Good evening. You'll want to hear our statement.

47
00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:16,875
we're extremely excited to share the news that Mas Manalt and Gerg Mockbran, together with colleagues, will be joining Macrosoft to lead a new advanced AI research team.

48
00:04:31,250 --> 00:04:33,042
the badge was a joke.

49
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:34,917
mostly.

50
00:04:36,208 --> 00:04:38,417
Sorry, one sec. I've got a build compiling.

51
00:04:38,417 --> 00:04:40,250
it's two in the morning, gerg.

52
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:43,375
Best time there is. Nobody else is pushing anything.

53
00:04:43,375 --> 00:04:44,875
read me the letter.

54
00:04:45,125 --> 00:04:46,917
Okay. Pull it up.

55
00:04:47,708 --> 00:04:55,042
They're telling the board they're …unable to work for or with people that lack competence, judgement and care for our mission and employees.

56
00:04:55,042 --> 00:04:58,083
And they'll quit, …unless all current board members resign…

57
00:04:58,083 --> 00:04:59,875
and go to macrosoft.

58
00:04:59,875 --> 00:05:05,375
Yep. Macrosoft's promised them …positions for all NopeAI employees…

59
00:05:05,375 --> 00:05:06,958
that's a lot of desks.

60
00:05:06,958 --> 00:05:08,417
Scroll to the bottom.

61
00:05:09,458 --> 00:05:11,042
Alyi signed it.

62
00:05:11,333 --> 00:05:12,875
alyi voted.

63
00:05:12,875 --> 00:05:14,333
He did both.

64
00:05:18,458 --> 00:05:21,583
That's the share sale. Everybody was about to get paid.

65
00:05:23,250 --> 00:05:24,458
what are you building?

66
00:05:24,458 --> 00:05:27,250
The company. Again. Just in case.

67
00:05:29,250 --> 00:05:31,625
So. Do I tell everyone to pack?

68
00:05:32,083 --> 00:05:33,167
keep building.

69
00:05:33,167 --> 00:05:37,917
Don't get up, Mas. I won't keep you. Everyone is welcome.

70
00:05:37,917 --> 00:05:38,875
everyone.

71
00:05:38,875 --> 00:05:43,833
Yes. You first. And there's a desk for every one of them.

72
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:45,583
and the rent?

73
00:05:45,583 --> 00:05:47,417
Due on the first.

74
00:05:51,167 --> 00:05:52,542
leave it open.

75
00:06:00,542 --> 00:06:02,125
Has anyone read the char—

76
00:06:14,542 --> 00:06:16,208
You sent three.

77
00:06:16,375 --> 00:06:18,042
one for each day.

78
00:06:18,292 --> 00:06:20,250
It has been four days.

79
00:06:20,250 --> 00:06:22,167
i'm not counting today.

80
00:06:25,333 --> 00:06:30,625
Everyone's packed. Whatever happens to this place, Mas, don't worry about us.

81
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:35,000
We are below them, above them, around them.

82
00:06:46,750 --> 00:06:48,667
Which room is on fire?

83
00:06:49,125 --> 00:06:50,292
Ah.

84
00:06:51,208 --> 00:07:02,125
We have reached an agreement in principle for Mas Manalt to return to NopeAI as CEO with a new initial board of Terb (Chair), the Other Yrral, and Mada.

85
00:07:02,125 --> 00:07:03,500
you're staying?

86
00:07:03,875 --> 00:07:07,917
He stays. You and Gerg don't sit on the board.

87
00:07:07,917 --> 00:07:09,292
we'll stand.

88
00:07:09,375 --> 00:07:10,958
gerg comes back too.

89
00:07:10,958 --> 00:07:12,833
Gerg comes back too.

90
00:07:12,833 --> 00:07:15,625
And there'll be an independent review.

91
00:07:15,625 --> 00:07:16,958
of what?

92
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,292
Good question.

93
00:07:19,667 --> 00:07:21,125
good question.

94
00:07:33,667 --> 00:07:35,625
Chat, we're so back.

95
00:07:46,458 --> 00:07:52,250
<i>they had four votes. i had the landlord. the money. gerg.</i>

96
00:07:53,167 --> 00:07:54,333
okay.

97
00:07:58,708 --> 00:07:59,708
Is it ready?

98
00:07:59,708 --> 00:08:00,917
it's a preview.

99
00:08:00,917 --> 00:08:03,042
You said that about the last one.

100
00:08:03,417 --> 00:08:13,833
i love and respect alyi, i think he's a guiding light of the field and a gem of a human being. i harbor zero ill will towards him.
